## Deck:  US standard card deck (without jokers) -- in the outline style
// First in the project:  a card says `- suit is a suit of its deck`, so the deck's kinds come before it.
// So what a deck DOES reads only what a card says it is:  its name, rank and suit, not `short name`.
a "deck" is a list of cards with:
	- "suits" as one of clubs, diamonds, hearts or spades
	- the "color" of a suit is:
		red if it is diamonds or hearts
		black otherwise
	- "ranks" as one of ace, 2 ... 10, jack, queen or king
	- a rank "is a face card" if it is jack, queen or king

	// a new deck holds one of each card, ace of clubs first
	- to create it:
		for each rank in deck ranks
			for each suit in deck suits
				get a new card with rank = the rank, suit = the suit
				add it to the deck

	- to display it:
		set card-names to a new list of text
		for each card in the deck
			add the name of the card to card-names
		echo "deck: " + card-names


## Tests
to test deck creation
	the deck is a new deck
	the number of cards in the deck should be 52
	set the queens to the cards in the deck where the rank of the card is "queen"
	the number of cards in the queens should be 4
	the name of the bottom card of the deck should be "king-of-spades"
	the name of the top card of the deck should be "ace-of-clubs"

	echo "the deck before shuffling:"
	display the deck
	the name of the first card of the deck should be "ace-of-clubs"
